{"5401770":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Tinker to the Moon","steam_appid":5401770,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"A chair. A spring. A very distant Moon. Your first flight won't get you far, but it will earn you money for better parts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One more flight. One better machine.<\/h2>Launch, earn money, improve your machine and try again. Beat your height record to discover new ideas. Choose what to buy next: a stronger spring, more lift or an engine with enough fuel for a longer climb.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/1914821b84dba762ee3fcfcd415608a1.poster.avif?t=1793718012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/1914821b84dba762ee3fcfcd415608a1.webm?t=1793718012\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/1914821b84dba762ee3fcfcd415608a1.mp4?t=1793718012\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build it, then take the controls<\/h2>Fit wings, balloons and engines in your seaside workshop and see your invention change. In the air, steer and control your power. Watch fuel and heat, then use the flight report to plan your next improvement.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/c67444af6f49953cb777060d715357e6.poster.avif?t=1793718012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/c67444af6f49953cb777060d715357e6.webm?t=1793718012\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/c67444af6f49953cb777060d715357e6.mp4?t=1793718012\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the beach to the Moon<\/h2>Work through 13 ideas, from spring-powered hops to propellers, jets and rockets. Take on optional delivery flights and challenges, experiment in the sandbox, or keep chasing records in Endless mode.","about_the_game":"A chair. A spring. A very distant Moon. Your first flight won't get you far, but it will earn you money for better parts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One more flight. One better machine.<\/h2>Launch, earn money, improve your machine and try again. Beat your height record to discover new ideas. Choose what to buy next: a stronger spring, more lift or an engine with enough fuel for a longer climb.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/1914821b84dba762ee3fcfcd415608a1.poster.avif?t=1793718012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/1914821b84dba762ee3fcfcd415608a1.webm?t=1793718012\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/1914821b84dba762ee3fcfcd415608a1.mp4?t=1793718012\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build it, then take the controls<\/h2>Fit wings, balloons and engines in your seaside workshop and see your invention change. In the air, steer and control your power. Watch fuel and heat, then use the flight report to plan your next improvement.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/c67444af6f49953cb777060d715357e6.poster.avif?t=1793718012\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/c67444af6f49953cb777060d715357e6.webm?t=1793718012\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/extras\/c67444af6f49953cb777060d715357e6.mp4?t=1793718012\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the beach to the Moon<\/h2>Work through 13 ideas, from spring-powered hops to propellers, jets and rockets. Take on optional delivery flights and challenges, experiment in the sandbox, or keep chasing records in Endless mode.","short_description":"Launch a chair on springs. Earn money, bolt on better parts, and fly higher. Turn your unlikely invention into a balloon, a propeller plane, then a rocket in this physics-based upgrade game. The goal? The Moon.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Hindi","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/7418a1ca7f25dd01beb078e478378082489d101e\/header.jpg?t=1793718012","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/53d61b7793198ab4540e48be0dcf4dfd2447086f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793718012","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5401770\/53d61b7793198ab4540e48be0dcf4dfd2447086f\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793718012","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD Radeon RX 550 or equivalent with Vulkan 1.2 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Keyboard and mouse required. An OpenGL 3.3 compatibility launch option is available.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 \/ AMD Radeon RX 560 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Pinch Games"],"publishers":["Pinch Games"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":499,"final":299,"discount_percent":40,"initial_formatted":"4,99€","final_formatted":"2,99€"},"packages":[1865054],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Tinker to the Moon","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1865054,"percent_savings_text":"-40% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Tinker to the Moon - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">4,99€<\/span> 2,99€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":299}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,